            "description": {
              "value": "You are among the most common of changelings\u2014those born to sweet hags\u2014and a vibrant green eye signifies that parentage. Your mother's manipulative nature and versatile voice gives you an edge when deceiving others. You gain the Charming Liar skill feat. If you roll Deception for initiative, foes in that combat encounter that haven't acted yet are off-guard against you."
